<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Set your AlignTraits password</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f2f5f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#002650;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ee;border-radius:12px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:28px;">
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dnd6g0t90/image/upload/v1734808959/full-logo_jvosfh.png" alt="AlignTraits" width="160" style="display:block;margin:0 0 20px;">
        <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;color:#004085;">Hi <%= name %>, set your password</h1>
        <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">You used AlignTraits with this email. Set a password to see your results and come back to them any time.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">Type this code on the AlignTraits page you have open:</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:32px;line-height:40px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:8px;color:#004085;"><%= code %></p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">Or open the page on this device:</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">
          <a href="<%= url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;background:#004085;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;">Set my password</a>
        </p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#33669d;">The code works once and expires in 30 minutes. Never share it with anyone, AlignTraits will never ask for it. If you did not use AlignTraits, ignore this email and nothing will change.</p>
        <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">The AlignTraits team</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p style="max-width:600px;margin:14px auto 0;font-size:12px;color:#33669d;text-align:center;">You are getting this email because someone asked to set a password for <%= email %> on aligntraits.com.</p>
</body>
</html>
